{
  "name": "SocialPro - Progreso y avisos 70-80-100",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "hourly-trigger",
      "name": "Cada hora",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -500,
        0
      ],
      "disabled": false
    },
    {
      "id": "internal-probe-progress",
      "name": "Verificación interna autenticada",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -500,
        180
      ],
      "webhookId": "socialpro-guard-probe-progress",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "socialpro-internal-check-progress-20260905",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_INTERNAL_GUARD_HEADER_AUTH_ID",
          "name": "SocialPro Internal Guard Header Auth"
        }
      },
      "notes": "Prueba interna autorizada. Digest/progreso usan body.probe=true; los lectores solo aceptan mensajes nuevos. Importación segura: asignar la credencial Header Auth autorizada (Authorization: Bearer del CRM), sin pegar secretos en nodos. Requiere guard inicializado, T0 y actores permitidos persistentes."
    },
    {
      "id": "durable-internal-progress",
      "name": "Procesar progress con registro persistente",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        40,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_INTERNAL_GUARD_HEADER_AUTH_ID",
          "name": "SocialPro Internal Guard Header Auth"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://socialpro-internal-guard:8787/run/progress",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json.body || {}) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 170000
        }
      },
      "notes": "Sólo rutas internas permitidas; ledger fsync, identidad estable y recibo Discord antes de ACK. No facturas, pagos, emails, contratos ni replay histórico. Código versionado: infra/n8n/guard. Importación segura: asignar la credencial Header Auth autorizada (Authorization: Bearer del CRM), sin pegar secretos en nodos. Requiere guard inicializado, T0 y actores permitidos persistentes."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cada hora": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Procesar progress con registro persistente",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Verificación interna autenticada": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Procesar progress con registro persistente",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "timezone": "Europe/Madrid",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "saveDataSuccessExecution": "all",
    "saveDataErrorExecution": "all",
    "executionTimeout": 600
  },
  "active": false
}
